<title>JAPAN: Nihon Parkerizing - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Parkerizing - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 19.62		vs	   17.36</p>
<p> Operating	  571    mln	  vs	  490    mln</p>
<p> Current	    944    mln	  vs	  900    mln</p>
<p> Net		  388    mln	  vs	  366    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    5.86 yen	  vs	    5.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     66 million	  vs	  66 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Parkerizing Co Ltd is a chemical company with focus on rust preventives.</p>
